#title Shallow
#author Bradley Cooper, Lady Gaga
#category Piosenki zagraniczne

#verse
Tell me something, girl ~ e D G
Are you happy in this modern world? ~ C G D
Or do you need more? ~ e D G
Is there somethin' else you're searching for? ~ C G D

#chorus
I'm falling ~ e D G
In all the good times I find myself ~ C G D
Longin' for change ~ e D G
And in the bad times I fear myself ~ C G D

#verse
Tell me something, boy ~ e D G
Aren't you tired tryin' to fill that void? ~ C G D
Or do you need more? ~ e D G
Ain't it hard keeping it so hardcore? ~ C G D

#chorus
I'm falling ~ e D G
In all the good times I find myself ~ C G D
Longing for a change ~ e D G
And in the bad times I fear myself ~ C G D

#verse
I'm off the deep end, watch as I dive in ~ a D
I'll never meet the ground ~ G D e
Crash through the surface, where they can't hurt us ~ a D
We're far from the shallow now ~ G D e

#chorus
In the sha-ha, sha-hallow ~ a D
In the sha-ha, sha-la-la-la-low ~ G D e
In the sha-ha, sha-hallow ~ a D
We're far from the shallow now ~ G D e

